msgid ""
"Off: your community plugin decides who can see this site. Turn on its "
"private or members-only mode to hide WP MediaVerse from visitors."
msgstr ""
"Uit: je communityplugin bepaalt wie deze site kan zien. Schakel de privé- "
"of ledenmodus van die plugin in om WP MediaVerse voor bezoekers te "
"verbergen."

